            "body": "I'm closing this because this is a support question and not something to actually implement in Cython itself. Support questions can be asked on [the Cython user's mailing list](https://groups.google.com/g/cython-users/)\n\nI think the answer is likely to be \"Cython doesn't obfuscate things particularly well but there's no real mechanism for getting your original source back\". My other thought is that you should ask people interested in AI-based reverse engineering rather than people interested in Cython specifically.",
